'''True Assassin''' (真アサシン, ''Shin Asashin'', '''True Assassin''') is a [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemy that appears in the [[Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 15.4 Update|Version 15.4]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = True Assassin
|image = E 778.png
|first appearance = [[True Assassin's Gauntlet]]
|money drop = 1,000¢ - 3,950¢
}}

==Enemy==
True Assassin attacks rapidly with [[Long Distance]] reaching up to 700 range. However, its 5 knockbacks can be used to your advantage, as heavy hitters with below 350 range can easily sneak into its blindspot and stagger it, unless support gets in the way.

==Strategy==
Use fast heavy hitters or [[:Category:Rusher-class Cats|Rushers]] that can fit into its blindspot like [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]], [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]], [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]], [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]], etc. to deal a load of damage quickly. Talented [[Cats in a Box (Special Cat)|Heavy Assault C.A.T]] and [[Dom Cat (Special Cat)|Dark Lazer]] work pretty well in exploiting its Dark trait.

